WEBVTT

00:00.400 --> 00:04.207
Seven years after the Lance, Aurel is going out.

00:04.217 --> 00:07.977
Survey Seven, the Plumbline, went anyway.

00:09.400 --> 00:12.400
Something warm was waiting on the line.

00:12.900 --> 00:16.090
And the cartographer woke in glass.

00:17.417 --> 00:19.347
Farstrand.

00:37.120 --> 00:40.020
WREN (echo): Heliopause. Last of the sun. The Seed's right there.

00:40.500 --> 00:43.790
MOTT (echo): Kiddo, something gold shot past me. Outbound. In a hurry.

00:43.800 --> 00:46.110
MOTT: Welcome to the Magpie, kiddo!
